# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated binaries: regenerable, large, and rewritten under the same names on
# every run, so git history is the wrong place for them.
#
# Painted art from tools/gen/comfy.mjs. The art track re-renders these hourly;
# the real backup is robocopy snapshots under D:\Tools\pyrefly-art-backup\.
public/art/
#
# Audio previews from tools/render-track.mjs (~10 MB each). Nothing ships as an
# audio file — the game synthesises everything at runtime — so these are
# previews only and regenerate with `node tools/render-track.mjs all`.
# (Four early previews were committed before this rule and remain tracked.)
docs/audio/*.wav
# Audition copies from `npm run audio:render -- --audition`: byte-identical to
# what already ships in public/audio/, kept only for listening locally.
docs/audio/audition/

# local release zips and release build output
releases/
dist-release/

# scratch harnesses and probe dumps
critic/scratch/
